Package: gtUtils
Title: Enhancements and Utilities for the gt Package
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Andrew", "Weatherman", , "andrew@aweatherman.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of themes, formatters, and annotation helpers that
    extend the 'gt' package. Includes editorial and broadcast-style table themes,
    continuous color legends, positional cut lines, significance notation,
    outlier flagging, and utilities for cropping and padding saved tables for
    publication or social media.
